.TH tujson n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
 tujson \- small JSON helper and parser
.SH SYNOPSIS
 package require tclutils::tujson
.br
 ::tclutils::tujson::parse json
.br
 ::tclutils::tujson::pretty json ?-indent string?
.br
 ::tclutils::tujson::minify json
.br
 ::tclutils::tujson::validate json
.SH DESCRIPTION
 tujson provides dependency-free JSON helpers in pure Tcl.  It can quote,
escape, minify, pretty-print, validate, and parse JSON text.  Parsed JSON
objects become Tcl dictionaries and JSON arrays become Tcl lists.
.SH SEE ALSO
 tucsv(n), tuxml(n)
